了，\n\n做服务不仅仅是卖东西，老人给我上了一课，让我懂得了，\n\n服务无止境的道理，是啊！我们要做的还有很多，只要我们\n\n做一点点，生活就会更加美好。\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1007_609_1137_724.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"10%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_479_760_623_1221.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_662_760_993_1210.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"27%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 一 把雨伞", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1085_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5c280afb-6b5d-4aae-8b8a-64a18c3dac4f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1085_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A38%3A10Z%2F-1%2F%2F854dd351ac1ade82c1536f2f4a6a8a654079ad9c4a39fa9c1ceac9d2c4557c65", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1007_609_1137_724.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5c280afb-6b5d-4aae-8b8a-64a18c3dac4f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1007_609_1137_724.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A38%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa371acc07a90e3c8e54b004f273466f9bf52f52b814c72c876cde85f881c007b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_479_760_623_1221.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5c280afb-6b5d-4aae-8b8a-64a18c3dac4f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_479_760_623_1221.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A38%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F07ab018cad1f8c7cf033fca1236c321b136b33a8dfc22fc2823a68389df96871", "imgs/img_in_image_box_662_760_993_1210.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5c280afb-6b5d-4aae-8b8a-64a18c3dac4f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_662_760_993_1210.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A38%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F5344afc46e45b